# NOTE: src/ must be published for the assessment to run in a browser,
# so the scoring logic is readable by anyone who opens developer tools.
# Excluding these two directories is defence in depth, not real
# protection. Hiding the engine requires moving scoring server-side.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
